**Purpose**: Reporting dashboards and cross-cutting UI polish

- [ ] T025 [P] Implement project progress and burndown analytics endpoint (`GET /api/reports/projects`) in `backend/src/reports.ts`.
- [ ] T026 [P] Create `frontend/components/ReportsView.vue` with visual project completion progress rings and burndown charts.
- [ ] T027 Add copy tag helper button to tag pills in `frontend/components/TaskList.vue`.
